<p dir="auto">Add contrast-color() function page.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">The feature is in Safari Technology Preview now.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">The function is completely different now from the original <code class="notranslate">color-contrast()</code> function. The current version is simple, accepting only one parameter and returning only two possible values.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-5/#contrast-color" rel="nofollow">https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-5/#contrast-color</a></li>
