    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Initial content for Integrity-Policy]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39815</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39815"/>
        <updated>2025-06-07T08:19:14.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/786187?u=ea03cb781b69bbae33dbd354c0902e37ea57a438&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>




<hr>
<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">This documents the Integrity-Policy headers.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">I recently added Integrity-Policy to the platform, and I'd like to document it so developers can use it.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-subresource-integrity/#integrity-policy-section" rel="nofollow">https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-subresource-integrity/#integrity-policy-section</a><br>
<a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5178394056327168" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5178394056327168</a><br>
